# This is the one Scoutro tool that is not a thin API client: prospect
# discovery needs several API calls (search + crawl) plus a filter and a small
# persistent state. It still uses only the public Scoutro API - no YaCy core
# change and no extra service.
#
# Pipeline:
#   DISCOVERY (Freeworld live search) -> FILTER -> ACCEPTED DOMAIN
#     -> safety/robots pre-check -> crawl.start with collection=prospect-<profile>
